{# Shared "no driver under contract" notice. Shown on Cockpit, Race Strategy and
   Testing when the account has a calendar + tyre supplier but no pilot. Points
   the user at the Recruitment Analyzer. Caution idiom (amber left-accent bar). #}
<div class="notice notice-warn">
    <p class="font-bold">No driver under contract.</p>
    <p class="mt-1">
        Hire a driver in GPRO, then re-sync. Not sure who to sign?
        Use the <a href="/recruitment" class="font-semibold underline hover:no-underline">Recruitment Analyzer</a>
        to find the best available driver for your division.
    </p>
</div>
